	(text "LOGIC ANALYSER: Kingst LA5016 40-way cable into J1601. Key-side row (odd pins): 1-15 CH0-7, 17 GND,\n19-33 CH8-15, 35 GND, 37 PWM1, 39 PWM2 (LA outputs). Even row reserved for the LA5032 (18/36 GND).\nCH: 0 SCL, 1 SDA, 2 GPS PPS, 3 GPS TX, 4 m1421 SUTX, 5 m1421 SURX, 6 SYNC, 7 SD26 | 8 P4 console TX,\n9 C5 console TX, 10 user UART TX, 11 SD27, 12 PM ALERT, 13 CHG/PD INT, 14 DBG_A, 15 DBG_B. 100R series each.\nH1601-H1604: M2.5 panel holes at 156 x 89 mm (Waveshare drawing). Rail test points are on each power sheet."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
